[[File:Tomb of Ancestors.png|thumb|300px|The Tomb of Ancestors.]]
The '''Tomb of Ancestors''' is an ancient burial ground tucked away in the south of the [[Grim Hollow]], in the [[Grim Reaches]]. As old as Grim Batol itself, the [[Wildhammer dwarves]] laid their dead to rest there ages ago and carved their names in runestone and memory. However, a darkness has seeped into the Hollow as of late, and the dead aren't resting like they should. Spirits are drifting through the fog, restless.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|37|The Grim Hollow (quest)|The Grim Hollow}}</ref> Deep within the tomb, the [[skardyn]] sorcerer [[Thromrar Darkflame]] performs a dark ritual, ensnaring the minds of the red dragonkin that patrol the swamp and raising the fallen ancestors of the Wildhammer, a herald of [[Grim Batol|greater darkness]].

